- Why: between 18:52 and 19:44 UTC four hunt runs of Military sold 13 superfluid vials (7,800 cr) that surplus.py held back, three of them on a sentinel hunt my turn check did not read; Intel's scout hunt sold 6 caustic sacs (errors.log ENT-095). A check at the turn sees it hours late; the runner sees it at the sale.
